---
title: "Rol de la consola"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: ok
    lg1: busy
    lg2: wait
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 tan
  s0: Setup pending
  s1: Setup done
  s2: Password rotated
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the server accepts the database
  s1 --> s2: the password rotates
  s2 --> s1: setup runs once for the new password
  class s0 tan
  class s1 teal
  class s2 yellow
